      "text": "THE SPLIT.  plan.json carries two kinds of thing and they never meet again until the canvas.  GLYPH \u2192 FLUX, wordless.  LABEL, NOTE, TITLE \u2192 drawn as Excalidraw TEXT, crisp and editable.",
